<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Residual-Connection on</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/categories/residual-connection/</link><description>Recent content in Residual-Connection on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://younsoid.github.io/categories/residual-connection/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>잔차 연결 (2)</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp14/</link><pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp14/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="잔차-연결-2"&gt;&#10; 잔차 연결 (2)&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%9e%94%ec%b0%a8-%ec%97%b0%ea%b2%b0-2"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-10-19&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;해당 층의 입력을 출력에 더하면 이전 입력에 담긴 잡음 없는 정보가 유지되어서 그레디언트 소실을 막는다고 했는데 이 부분을 summary 출력으로 확인해보았다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;inputs &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; keras&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Input(shape&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;32&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;32&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;))&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;x &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; layers&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Rescaling(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;255&lt;/span&gt;)(inputs)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;residual_block&lt;/span&gt;(x, filters, pooling&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;False&lt;/span&gt;):&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; residual&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;x&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; x &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; layers&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Conv2D(filters, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;, activation&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;relu&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, padding&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;same&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)(x)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; x &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; layers&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Conv2D(filters, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;, activation&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;relu&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, padding&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;same&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)(x)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; pooling:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; x &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; layers&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;MaxPooling2D(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;, padding&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;same&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; residual &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; layers&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Conv2D(filters, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;, strides&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;)(residual)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;elif&lt;/span&gt; filters &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;!=&lt;/span&gt; residual&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;shape[&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;]:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; residual &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; layers&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Conv2D(filters, &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;)(residual)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; x &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; layers&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;add([x, residual])&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; x&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;x &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; residual_block(x, filters&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;32&lt;/span&gt;, pooling&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;x &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; residual_block(x, filters&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;64&lt;/span&gt;, pooling&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;True&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;x &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; residual_block(x, filters&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;128&lt;/span&gt;, pooling&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;False&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;x &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; layers&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;GlobalAveragePooling2D()(x)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;outputs &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; layers&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Dense(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;, activation&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;sigmoid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)(x)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;model &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; keras&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;Model(inputs&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;inputs, outputs&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;outputs)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;model&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;summary()&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;먼저 summary 출력해볼 모델인데 구조는 이렇다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>잔차 연결</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp8/</link><pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/deep-learning/computer-vision/cp8/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="잔차-연결"&gt;&#10; 잔차 연결&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ec%9e%94%ec%b0%a8-%ec%97%b0%ea%b2%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-10-09&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;컨브넷 아키텍처를 설계할 때 유용한 방법으로는 잔차 연결, 배치 정규화, 깊이별 분리 합성곱 등이 있다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-잔차-연결"&gt;&#10; 1. 잔차 연결&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#1-%ec%9e%94%ec%b0%a8-%ec%97%b0%ea%b2%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;y = f4(f3(f2(f1(x))))라는 네트워크가 있을때, 역전파는 오차 신호가 f4에서 f1 방향으로 거슬러 가는 것이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이때 각 함수에는 일정량의 잡음이 있고 함수 연결이 너무 깊으면 이 잡음이 그래디언트 정보를 넘어서서 역전파가 동작하지 않게 된다. (그레디언트 소실)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;그레디언트 소실을 해결하려면 해당 층의 입력을 출력에 더하면 된다. 그러면 이전 입력에 담긴 잡음 없는 정보가 유지된다. 이를 잔차 연결이라고 한다. &lt;gray&gt;(왜지?)&lt;/gray&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>